{"ticker":{"symbol":"033240.KS","name":"자화전자","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":15500.0,"change_pct":-0.05946601941747576,"market_cap":329312567296.0,"pe":4.1092257,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":14510.0,"week52_high":60000.0,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Electronic Components","country":"South Korea","city":"Cheongju","employees":1178,"website":"https://www.jahwa.co.kr","business_summary":"Jahwa Electronics. Co., Ltd manufactures and sells precision electronic components in South Korea and internationally. The company offers BLDC and geared motors, PTC heaters, and rare earth motors for automobiles; and camera modules, integrated OIS and shutter actuators, auto focus actuators, and vibration motors for mobiles. It also provides charge and supply rollers, magroller assemblies, and developer rollers for laser printers and copiers; PTC thermistors and plastic magnets for home appliances; and thermal spread sheets for displays, as well as Nd-Fe-B magnet. The company was founded in 1981 and is headquartered in Cheongju, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"자화전자. Co., Ltd는 한국 및 해외에서 정밀 전자 부품을 제조 및 판매합니다. 이 회사는 자동차용 BLDC 및 기어드 모터, PTC 히터, 희토류 모터를 제공합니다. 카메라 모듈, 통합 OIS 및 셔터 액추에이터, 자동 초점 액추에이터, 모바일용 진동 모터 등이 있습니다. 또한 레이저 프린터 및 복사기용 충전 및 공급 롤러, 마그롤러 어셈블리, 현상 롤러도 제공합니다. 가전제품용 PTC 서미스터 및 플라스틱 자석; 디스플레이용 방열시트, Nd-Fe-B 자석 등을 생산하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 1981년에 설립되었으며 본사는 대한민국 청주에 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":1005600000000.0,"rev_lo":1005600000000.0,"rev_hi":1005600000000.0,"rev_g":0.1846,"n":1,"eps":4449.0,"eps_lo":4449.0,"eps_hi":4449.0,"eps_g":0.9479},{"period":"2027","rev":1123200000000.0,"rev_lo":1006400000000.0,"rev_hi":1240000000000.0,"rev_g":0.1169,"n":2,"eps":3772.0,"eps_lo":3141.0,"eps_hi":4403.0,"eps_g":-0.1522}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"전자부품","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":292333491220.0,"operating_income":-11740371130.0,"net_income":-38182483930.0,"eps":-2101.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":5